[0.034278, "o", "\r\n367a899 fix(deploy): quote y and n again in converted manifests\r\n\r\ngo-yaml, which kubectl and the API server use, reads y, Y, n and N as booleans (YAML 1.1). 07a80bb stopped quoting them, so an env value of \"y\" was applied as a bool, and test_dump_docs_quotes_yaml11_ambiguous_strings failed. Restore the tokens.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Tong <jt572@cornell.edu>\r\n\r\n\r\n deploy/utils/convert_api_version.py | 6 +++++-\r\n 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\r\n"]
